{"id":"vod_sn_38449","vodId":"38449","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"六花的勇者","name_cn":"六花的勇者","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/e359932db33fd79396e686820a231d8a.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个虚构的世界之中，魔神即将从沉睡之中苏醒，世界将因此而成为鲜血和火焰的海洋，为了击败魔神使其再度沉睡，六名勇者被神意挑选了出来，他们的身上会出现花朵的纹章作为标识，人们称他们为“六花勇者”。　　然而，这一次，被选出的勇者却有七人，这也就意味着，性格奔放开朗的娜谢塔尼娅（日笠阳子 配音）、个性冷淡沉默寡言的芙蕾米（悠木碧 配音）、坚强的莫拉（佐藤利奈 配音）、拥有超高智商的汉斯（铃村健一 配音）、傲娇毒舌的茶末（加隈亚衣 配音）、成熟稳重的戈尔道夫（内山昂辉 配音）和胆小的洛洛尼亚（金元寿子 配音），在这些人之中，存在着一个叛徒。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:34","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Uyn2XtGznA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xFFWuXSu9p1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Ww14QdxAM81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/a5ZdADvKQA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8ruQGCQCHg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6Z7NXWZ7Hc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6HWaiU0jm41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gpzAVCkH451/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q5Wq7Wb1qE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GfxvWyCdzB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1Eia0X58Fm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q5jTTdUh2J1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:58.577Z"}